{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新的一天开始，感觉比起昨天，濑名在我面前更加敞开心扉了。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": "新的一天开始，感觉比起昨天，濑名在我面前更加敞开心扉了。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要用这个烧麦皮，\\n　无论包什么都会变得像点心一样呢……」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "「只要用这个烧麦皮，　无论包什么都会变得像点心一样呢……」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1469", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺便一提，今天的特别课程是烹饪实习，课题是包烧麦。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "顺便一提，今天的特别课程是烹饪实习，课题是包烧麦。", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果便宜的话，下次我想试着买一点。\\n　不觉得点心风格的便当也不错吗？」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "「如果便宜的话，下次我想试着买一点。　不觉得点心风格的便当也不错吗？」", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1470", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要里面包的不是腌萝卜什么的就好了」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别管那么多啦！再说了腌萝卜老早之前就吃完了」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "「别管那么多啦！再说了腌萝卜老早之前就吃完了」", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1471", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "各务台校女生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，那个，拜托不要在我们班的烧麦里面放青豌豆……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": "「那个，那个，拜托不要在我们班的烧麦里面放青豌豆……」", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sc0024", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没问题，今天的烧麦是正宗口味，我们班本来就没有拿那个」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "「没问题，今天的烧麦是正宗口味，我们班本来就没有拿那个」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1472", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，最好是没有啦……啊啊，之前在那边吃的时候，\\n　里面完全没有加其他食材真是太好了」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": "「总之，最好是没有啦……啊啊，之前在那边吃的时候，　里面完全没有加其他食材真是太好了」", "plain_idx": 238, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0168", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，没有其他食材就有些单调呢。\\n　刚开始吃的时候我觉得有些淡了」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "「但是，没有其他食材就有些单调呢。　刚开始吃的时候我觉得有些淡了」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1473", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理也经常去吃吗？」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0169", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……以前去过啦，以前。被妈妈突然拉去了，刚回过神来就坐上了飞机」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "「……以前去过啦，以前。被妈妈突然拉去了，刚回过神来就坐上了飞机」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1474", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "各务台校女生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇……这些大小姐随口就开始聊起海外旅行的话题了……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sc0025", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺便说一下，班级的人员分组已经以最开始的状态固定好了。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "顺便说一下，班级的人员分组已经以最开始的状态固定好了。", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "包括我在内的三个人，絮絮叨叨地包起了烧麦……", "text_idx": 250, "plain": "包括我在内的三个人，絮絮叨叨地包起了烧麦……", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，完成了。那快点开始蒸吧」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "「好了，完成了。那快点开始蒸吧」", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1475", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "各务台校女生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好！」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sc0026", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说，喂，那边的蠢货。为什么拿了两个蒸笼？\\n　还有这个红薯拿来干嘛？」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": "「话说，喂，那边的蠢货。为什么拿了两个蒸笼？　还有这个红薯拿来干嘛？」", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0170", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，这是濑名叫我拿来的」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是另外一种食材啦。\\n　现在也到了红薯的季节了，蒸了大家一起吃吧」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "「是、是另外一种食材啦。　现在也到了红薯的季节了，蒸了大家一起吃吧」", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1476", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "各务台校女生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦哦，大小姐果然懂得享受！」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sc0027", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，真是的，为什么爱理你总考虑得这么周到啊」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "「啊，真是的，为什么爱理你总考虑得这么周到啊」", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0171", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然了吧，只蒸一样就结束就有点……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1477", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，蒸的工作就让我们来做吧，全部都让爱理来做也不好」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "「那，蒸的工作就让我们来做吧，全部都让爱理来做也不好」", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0172", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
