{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了。那就让纱凪她们来蒸，我们来做这边的工作吧」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": "「好了。那就让纱凪她们来蒸，我们来做这边的工作吧」", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1481", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，嗯，好，那开始吧」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还有一次——", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……对了，这个跟昨天看的是同一部漫画吧，\\n　总感觉画得完全不一样呢……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "「……对了，这个跟昨天看的是同一部漫画吧，　总感觉画得完全不一样呢……」", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1482", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
