{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是我接过黑板擦打算把上面的部分擦干净——", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "于是我接过黑板擦打算把上面的部分擦干净——", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……诶？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等等等等，濑名！你去哪？」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我慌慌张张地擦完了黑板之后，追着濑名跑到了走廊上。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……办公室。要去问问明天班会的事，\\n　冷静下来想想的话现在可不是看漫画的时候」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "「……办公室。要去问问明天班会的事，　冷静下来想想的话现在可不是看漫画的时候」", "plain_idx": 316, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1485", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是因为我讲话讲一半去帮其他女生的忙，所以濑名闹别扭了吗……？", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "是因为我讲话讲一半去帮其他女生的忙，所以濑名闹别扭了吗……？", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等下等下，我也去」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你就擦黑板吧」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1486", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「黑板已经擦完了」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就去给其他女生帮忙吧」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1487", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉。我首先应该帮先来找我借漫画的濑名才是」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "「……抱歉。我首先应该帮先来找我借漫画的濑名才是」", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1488", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「去办公室吧？\\n　那个，回来的时候还要继续聊漫画的事情呢」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「去办公室吧？　那个，回来的时候还要继续聊漫画的事情呢」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1489", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有很多我还不明白的地方啊，比如说跨页的一格漫画该怎么去看」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": "「还有很多我还不明白的地方啊，比如说跨页的一格漫画该怎么去看」", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1490", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好不容易得到濑名的同意，我飞快地就开始说。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那个是……」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有一件事！我去完办公室之后，当然就要开始工作了吧。\\n　可不要说什么因为要擦黑板所以没空之类的话啊」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "「还有一件事！我去完办公室之后，当然就要开始工作了吧。　可不要说什么因为要擦黑板所以没空之类的话啊」", "plain_idx": 337, "len": 52, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1491", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所～以～说～黑板已经擦完了啦～」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我边走着边打趣，内心却心动不已。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "我边走着边打趣，内心却心动不已。", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——那个濑名，居然会做出像这种吃醋一般的行为。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": "——那个濑名，居然会做出像这种吃醋一般的行为。", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，到了放学后。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「忙到挺晚的呢」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉。我今天说了不少废话」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "「抱歉。我今天说了不少废话」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1492", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的，就算是班级委员的工作，\\n　也是边聊边做，开心地完成会更好吧」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": "「没事的，就算是班级委员的工作，　也是边聊边做，开心地完成会更好吧」", "plain_idx": 347, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1493", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个啊，瓜生」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1494", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以的话，能来一趟我家吗？我有些话想说」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": "「可以的话，能来一趟我家吗？我有些话想说」", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1495", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……就这样，我被邀请到了她家。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我当然是不可能拒绝的。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "更何况她这么直白地邀请我去……", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说，怎么样了？\\n　哮喘是什么时候治好的？」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": "「所以说，怎么样了？　哮喘是什么时候治好的？」", "plain_idx": 358, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1496", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名在自己家里坐下之后，热情地开始问起了我以前的事情。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": "濑名在自己家里坐下之后，热情地开始问起了我以前的事情。", "plain_idx": 360, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她想了解更多关于我的事。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样的感情径直传递到了我这里。我既开心又煎熬。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": "这样的感情径直传递到了我这里。我既开心又煎熬。", "plain_idx": 362, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1497", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，嗯，嗯。抱歉抱歉」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊……我也不知道从什么时候开始就不再有症状了，\\n　但是现在我仍然对灰尘过敏」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": "「是啊……我也不知道从什么时候开始就不再有症状了，　但是现在我仍然对灰尘过敏」", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗……所以瓜生你才对气氛那么敏感呢」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": "「是吗……所以瓜生你才对气氛那么敏感呢」", "plain_idx": 368, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1498", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "倒也不是，除了和濑名以外，最近我已经没那么会察言观色了……", "text_idx": 370, "plain": "倒也不是，除了和濑名以外，最近我已经没那么会察言观色了……", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我还是想着只要回应她一个人就可以了。\\n原来坠入爱河的男人会变成这样，真是有些滑稽。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": "但是，我还是想着只要回应她一个人就可以了。原来坠入爱河的男人会变成这样，真是有些滑稽。", "plain_idx": 372, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，没想到你会这么烦恼于家人的事……\\n　我还想着樱乃她完全没在意呢」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": "「但是，没想到你会这么烦恼于家人的事……　我还想着樱乃她完全没在意呢」", "plain_idx": 374, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1499", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说回来瓜生，你的父母完全不回家的吗？」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": "「话说回来瓜生，你的父母完全不回家的吗？」", "plain_idx": 376, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1500", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，算是吧，从以前开始就是那样……」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无论如何，我都一直在回应她。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我知道这是她的愿望。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就是你和樱乃两个人一直分担着家务咯？也就是说——」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "「那就是你和樱乃两个人一直分担着家务咯？也就是说——」", "plain_idx": 381, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1501", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我越是回应她，她就越靠近我，越想要倾吐话语。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "我越是回应她，她就越靠近我，越想要倾吐话语。", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯——」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": "「嗯——」", "plain_idx": 384, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像是……", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到了绝无仅有的光辉，不由得沉醉其中一样。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": "看到了绝无仅有的光辉，不由得沉醉其中一样。", "plain_idx": 386, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊！都这个时间了！」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1502", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在我们聊这聊那的时候，濑名突然跳了起来。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": "就在我们聊这聊那的时候，濑名突然跳了起来。", "plain_idx": 389, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知不觉间，窗外夜幕已垂。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": "不知不觉间，窗外夜幕已垂。", "plain_idx": 390, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……话说回来濑名，你还在打工的吧」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，现在出门应该勉强能赶上……！\\n　呃～啊～呃～……」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": "「嗯，现在出门应该勉强能赶上……！　呃～啊～呃～……」", "plain_idx": 393, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1503", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是备用钥匙！麻烦你锁好门……！\\n　那就我先走了明天见……！」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": "「这是备用钥匙！麻烦你锁好门……！　那就我先走了明天见……！」", "plain_idx": 396, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1504", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看起来真的很急，濑名把钥匙放在我面前之后就以惊人的气势飞奔了出去。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": "看起来真的很急，濑名把钥匙放在我面前之后就以惊人的气势飞奔了出去。", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就这样独自被留在濑名家里了。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀……嗯」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为她是个非常认真的人，所以是绝对不会容忍迟到的，这我也知道。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": "因为她是个非常认真的人，所以是绝对不会容忍迟到的，这我也知道。", "plain_idx": 401, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，她真的完全没有考虑过吧。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "把我这个男生独自留在女生家里是很危险的。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": "把我这个男生独自留在女生家里是很危险的。", "plain_idx": 403, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "啊啊，可恶，为什么我是男生啊。\\n无论怎么都没法抑制住自己涌出的滚滚邪念。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": "啊啊，可恶，为什么我是男生啊。无论怎么都没法抑制住自己涌出的滚滚邪念。", "plain_idx": 405, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这种简简单单地就能把她的房间翻个遍的情况下——", "text_idx": 406, "plain": "在这种简简单单地就能把她的房间翻个遍的情况下——", "plain_idx": 406, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……呼」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "什么都别想，什么都别想，我边对自己这么说着，边走出了濑名的家。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": "什么都别想，什么都别想，我边对自己这么说着，边走出了濑名的家。", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经用备用钥匙好好地把门锁上了。钥匙现在在我口袋里。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『新吾同学就像是兄长一样呢』", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0461", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想起了安洁说的话。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "诚如她所言……", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……当个“兄长”还真是辛苦啊」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
